# dëv-security — synthetic env-var template
#
# Real secrets live in `.env` (gitignored). This file documents the
# names a contributor (or rotation skill) should expect to find.

# ─── Demo artifact for the devsec-rotation-foundation v0.2 campaign ───
#
# Synthetic Class A self-generated token used by the campaign's
# end-to-end Python CLI rotation demo. The skill rotates this value via
# `pythonCliAdapter` against `security-scan --version` as the smoke
# command. Safe to remove if the demo is no longer interesting.
#
# See campaigns/devsec-rotation-foundation/receipts/02-demo-python-cli.md
# for the rotation receipt and `notes/demo-runs/python-cli/run-demo.ts`
# for the demo driver.
DEVSEC_GITHUB_TOKEN="replace-with-real-token-when-needed"
